   ```

5. Proxy accuracy note for the parent’s documentation/security category — severity 3, confidence 0.99  
   Location: `web/src/components/ProxyTab.tsx:61`  
   The claim that all chat streaming and speech transcription use `/api/chat-proxy` is false. `shouldProxyModel()` deliberately sends allowlisted providers directly, and Gemini transcription calls `@google/genai` directly; only OpenAI STT uses the proxy.
   ```tsx
   						Model discovery, chat streaming, speech transcription, and browser media tools use the same route.
   ```
   The line 68 “public HTTPS” claim also overstates validation: `proxy-target.ts` rejects literal/private-looking hostnames but does not resolve DNS, so a public-looking hostname resolving to a private address passes.

